WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.600
Our heroes are on their way to Snowbelle City

2
00:00:05.666 --> 00:00:07.300
and Ash's next Gym battle

3
00:00:07.366 --> 00:00:09.966
as Ash's training comes to a full boil.

4
00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:12.233
Greninja, water shuriken.

5
00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:15.033
Greninja!

6
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.733
- Pikachu, dodge and use electro ball.
- Pikachu! Pika!

7
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.800
All right, Greninja, now use cut.

8
00:00:21.466 --> 00:00:24.166
Greninja!

9
00:00:28.433 --> 00:00:31.233
Great stuff, Greninja. Time to use double team.

10
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.833
Wowee. They're into training like crazy.

11
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.500
I'm having a battle with them after dinner.

12
00:00:38.566 --> 00:00:41.900
Huh? Hey, Ash. You'll catch cold. Here.

13
00:00:41.966 --> 00:00:43.200
Huh?

14
00:00:43.266 --> 00:00:45.233
Don't worry. I'll be just fine.

15
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.800
I hear you've been quite successful in Kalos.

16
00:00:54.866 --> 00:00:58.100
- It appears you're all doing well.
- Sir.

17
00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.633
- Especially Meowth.
- Huh?

18
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.100
You deserve great praise for your intelligence

19
00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:07.166
and your robot-piloting skills in the service of catching Pikachu.

20
00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:09.500
Thanks. It's an honor.

21
00:01:09.933 --> 00:01:11.800
Let me reward you.

22
00:01:12.366 --> 00:01:13.733
Let me reward you.

23
00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.966
Let me reward you. Let me reward you.

24
00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:20.333
Uh, excuse me. I'm having trouble breathing.

25
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.633
Rewards are great, but oxygen is, too.

26
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.633
Meowth! Wobbuffet!

27
00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:26.666
Inkay!

28
00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:31.400
You can't sleep the day away. We've got a Pikachu to catch pronto.

29
00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:33.300
A good sleep comes from hard work.

30
00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.433
Oh, man. It was just a dumb dream.

31
00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.266
You kept saying "boss."

32
00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:41.666
Sounds like corporate dreaming to me.

33
00:01:41.733 --> 00:01:43.500
Corporate? Whatever.

34
00:01:43.566 --> 00:01:47.566
The point is, we've gotta catch that powerhouse Pikachu pronto.

35
00:01:47.633 --> 00:01:49.566
So good things can happen to me.

36
00:01:49.633 --> 00:01:51.066
- Wobba.
- Kay.

37
00:01:51.133 --> 00:01:53.466
- Huh?

38
00:01:53.533 --> 00:01:55.066
Check it out.

39
00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:58.933
That Pikachu you want can't be stronger than my Pikachu.

40
00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.500
- He's got it turned up to 12.
- At least.

41
00:02:05.566 --> 00:02:07.666
Turning it to zero would be my preference.

42
00:02:07.733 --> 00:02:10.300
Shredding the guitar on the road is my gig.

43
00:02:10.366 --> 00:02:13.233
Being Jimmy the Pikachu Trainer is, too.

44
00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.900
And this Pikachu is my partner, Spike, rocking the house.

45
00:02:18.766 --> 00:02:21.200
We're in search of other strong Pikachu.

46
00:02:21.266 --> 00:02:23.433
Uh... I think they blew a fuse.

47
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.200
Wobbuffet!

48
00:02:25.266 --> 00:02:28.200
So, where's that Pikachu you were rapping about?

49
00:02:29.133 --> 00:02:31.133
Like, who knew we could rap?

50
00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.133
Not I.

51
00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:33.433
Word up.

52
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.300
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

53
00:02:43.066 --> 00:02:46.233
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

54
00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:50.133
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

55
00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.800
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

56
00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:54.533
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

57
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.700
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

58
00:02:57.766 --> 00:03:01.000
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

59
00:03:01.066 --> 00:03:02.333
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

60
00:03:18.533 --> 00:03:20.333
Ash sure is taking his time.

61
00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.766
Because he was training almost until the sun came up.

62
00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:26.700
- Wake him up for us, will you, Bonnie?
- Sure.

63
00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:30.366
Oh, Ash. Breakfast is ready.

64
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.466
It's ready? It's ready.

65
00:03:33.533 --> 00:03:36.200
Morning. Go wash up. Hungry?

66
00:03:36.266 --> 00:03:37.933
Huh? Whoa!

67
00:03:39.566 --> 00:03:41.066
Huh?

68
00:03:44.633 --> 00:03:47.033
Now's our chance. Now! Now!

69
00:03:47.633 --> 00:03:48.500
What's wrong?

70
00:03:49.533 --> 00:03:50.566
I...

71
00:03:51.066 --> 00:03:52.233
I what?

72
00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:54.466
I...

73
00:03:57.133 --> 00:03:59.700
Iron tail, Pikachu.

74
00:04:00.966 --> 00:04:03.400
Oh, no!

75
00:04:03.466 --> 00:04:04.900
What's wrong?

76
00:04:04.966 --> 00:04:06.133
What do we do?

77
00:04:07.266 --> 00:04:10.300
Ash has a fever. He's burning up.

78
00:04:11.066 --> 00:04:12.900
He needs to get back to bed.

79
00:04:12.966 --> 00:04:14.100
Mm-hm.

80
00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:20.866
Pika, Pi.

81
00:04:20.933 --> 00:04:24.700
He must have a high fever. The washcloth gets warm so fast.

82
00:04:24.766 --> 00:04:28.666
He got soaked yesterday, so, he must've caught a really bad cold.

83
00:04:28.733 --> 00:04:31.500
- Pika.
- You must be worried, too.

84
00:04:31.566 --> 00:04:32.633
He'll be fine.

85
00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.800
I'll go get some medicine.

86
00:04:34.866 --> 00:04:36.766
Hey, I wanna go with you.

87
00:04:37.166 --> 00:04:38.166
Wait a minute.

88
00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.533
From where we are now, there's a pharmacy.

89
00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:45.366
- Just south of here. Take this with you.
- Okay.

90
00:04:47.133 --> 00:04:49.833
- Take good care of Ash for us.
- Dedenne.

91
00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.133
- Just leave it to me.
- Pika, Pika.

92
00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:54.633
We'll be back soon.

93
00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:02.000
I've gotta be strong, no matter what.

94
00:05:14.433 --> 00:05:16.066
Great, Pancham, Braixen.

95
00:05:16.133 --> 00:05:17.000
Thank you.

96
00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.766
He looks much better to me than before.

97
00:05:27.833 --> 00:05:29.300
- Pika?
- Mm-hm.

98
00:05:29.366 --> 00:05:32.233
We'll take care of everything until they bring the medicine.

99
00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.500
- Then Ash can get better.
- Pikachu.

100
00:05:38.266 --> 00:05:41.266
What in the world is making that deafening racket?

101
00:05:42.533 --> 00:05:45.333
Shredding guitar on the road is my gig.

102
00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.366
Being Jimmy the Pikachu Trainer is, too!

103
00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:49.733
What in the...?

104
00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:52.866
Pika?

105
00:05:52.933 --> 00:05:57.400
Oh, yeah! Does that Pikachu travel with Ash Ketchum from Pallet Town?

106
00:05:57.466 --> 00:05:59.366
Word has it it's really strong.

107
00:05:59.433 --> 00:06:01.300
- Pika.
- Really strong?

108
00:06:01.366 --> 00:06:02.400
Yes, it is.

109
00:06:02.466 --> 00:06:03.900
Yeah, yeah!

110
00:06:03.966 --> 00:06:07.166
I can't believe I found them in a flash. I'm so awesome.

111
00:06:07.233 --> 00:06:08.366
Pika, Pika.

112
00:06:09.033 --> 00:06:11.133
- Pika.
- I'm sorry. Could you keep it--?

113
00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.233
Let me guess.

114
00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:16.866
- You're one of Ash's buddies, am I right?
- Uh, yes, but here's the thing--

115
00:06:16.933 --> 00:06:21.366
- Listen up. Give him a message. Yeah!
- Pika, Pika!

116
00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:23.633
I'm into my Pikachu so much,

117
00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:27.433
I don't battle using any other Pokémon ever!

118
00:06:28.833 --> 00:06:33.966
If I hear there's a strong Pikachu out west, I go there to battle it!

119
00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:37.633
If there's a strong Pikachu out east, I go there, too.

120
00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:40.333
I'll go anywhere to prove my Pikachu can't be beat.

121
00:06:40.966 --> 00:06:45.600
- Uh, could you turn it down a little bit?
- Hey, Ash from Pallet Town.

122
00:06:45.666 --> 00:06:49.066
I challenge you to a rocking and rolling Pokémon battle.

123
00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.266
And not just any Pokémon battle.

124
00:06:52.333 --> 00:06:56.466
I'm talking full-out Pikachu against Pikachu!

125
00:06:56.533 --> 00:06:58.466
Stop it!

126
00:06:59.666 --> 00:07:01.700
That guy's gonna wake Ash up.

127
00:07:04.466 --> 00:07:06.733
It's time for battle, Ash.

128
00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:09.666
Show me you and your Pikachu's amazing skills.

129
00:07:09.733 --> 00:07:14.300
Okay, okay! I'll go get him. Now, stop shouting already.

130
00:07:14.366 --> 00:07:16.700
- You'll really go get him?
- Grr! Mm.

131
00:07:17.633 --> 00:07:19.166
Please wait right here.

132
00:07:23.666 --> 00:07:27.133
If Ash finds out he's been challenged, he'll wanna battle,

133
00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.533
even if he's in no condition to do so.

134
00:07:30.533 --> 00:07:31.800
Huh?

135
00:07:32.566 --> 00:07:35.566
Okay, Greninja, use double team.

136
00:07:38.633 --> 00:07:41.400
I can't let Ash get into a battle right now.

137
00:07:41.466 --> 00:07:46.700
But I doubt Jimmy is the kind to leave even if I tell him what the situation is.

138
00:07:46.766 --> 00:07:49.900
I said I'd take care of Ash, so, what am I gonna do?

139
00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.800
Huh? Ah.

140
00:07:58.266 --> 00:07:59.266
Hmm.

141
00:08:00.566 --> 00:08:03.533
I have to do it. For Ash's sake.

142
00:08:04.966 --> 00:08:06.600
- Huh?
- Pika?

143
00:08:10.466 --> 00:08:11.633
Here I am.

144
00:08:12.733 --> 00:08:14.933
I'm Ash Ketchum from Pallet Town.

145
00:08:18.433 --> 00:08:20.500
Who's that Pokémon?

146
00:08:25.433 --> 00:08:27.033
It's Kirlia!

147
00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.666
Kirlia!

148
00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.166
What do you think, kid? Check out my Pikachu.

149
00:08:35.233 --> 00:08:37.366
The strongest of the strongest.

150
00:08:37.799 --> 00:08:39.799
It's the ultimate Pikachu.

151
00:08:39.866 --> 00:08:43.333
Here's Spike. Yeah!

152
00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.333
Thank goodness he bought it.

153
00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.366
Okay. Stay calm, Serena.

154
00:08:47.433 --> 00:08:49.600
You've gotta do your best for Ash.

155
00:08:49.666 --> 00:08:50.833
- Pika.
- Huh?

156
00:08:51.533 --> 00:08:53.300
- Pika, Pika.
- Mm.

157
00:08:53.366 --> 00:08:54.666
Thank you, Pikachu.

158
00:08:56.233 --> 00:08:59.466
Who would have thought he would've made contact?

159
00:08:59.533 --> 00:09:02.466
He may play too loud, but at least he's determined.

160
00:09:02.533 --> 00:09:05.833
So, that loudmouth thinks he can beat the twerp's Pikachu?

161
00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:06.733
Hmm.

162
00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:10.200
Yeah. You can't win with determination alone.

163
00:09:11.566 --> 00:09:14.933
But on the off chance that they're really strong, I say

164
00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:18.233
we procure the twerp's Pikachu in a weakened state.

165
00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:21.133
- That sounds great.
- Wobba!

166
00:09:21.566 --> 00:09:24.433
Pikachu, I choose you!

167
00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.466
Pikachu!

168
00:09:25.533 --> 00:09:28.466
Excellent. You've got the first move.

169
00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.800
Now, Pikachu, quick attack, let's go.

170
00:09:36.266 --> 00:09:38.833
Same here. Use quick attack, too.

171
00:09:43.966 --> 00:09:45.833
Yeah! You're quick.

172
00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:49.733
Word on the street is straight up. And I'm getting stoked.

173
00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:52.533
It looks like this guy isn't just all talk.

174
00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:53.866
Pika.

175
00:09:53.933 --> 00:09:57.266
- That's a well-trained Pikachu.
- Spike, thunder punch.

176
00:09:57.333 --> 00:09:59.266
Pikachu!

177
00:09:59.333 --> 00:10:00.933
- Dodge it!
- Pika!

178
00:10:01.566 --> 00:10:04.900
- Now use thunderbolt.
- Pikachu!

179
00:10:04.966 --> 00:10:06.633
All right, Spike, use dig.

180
00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:14.000
Where's it going to attack from next?

181
00:10:14.066 --> 00:10:17.266
What would Ash do in a situation like this? Huh?

182
00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:19.033
- Pika!
- Hmm?

183
00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:21.166
Pika, Pika!

184
00:10:21.966 --> 00:10:23.400
Pikachu's right.

185
00:10:23.466 --> 00:10:27.233
I've watched Ash's battling style up close more than anybody.

186
00:10:27.633 --> 00:10:29.400
Iron tail again.

187
00:10:33.166 --> 00:10:36.200
Now, Pikachu! Use iron tail, let's go.

188
00:10:36.266 --> 00:10:39.400
Pikachu! Pika!

189
00:10:40.033 --> 00:10:41.333
Pika!

190
00:10:41.766 --> 00:10:43.933
- What was that about?
- Great job!

191
00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.166
Use iron tail once more.

192
00:10:46.233 --> 00:10:47.466
Pikachu!

193
00:10:54.933 --> 00:10:56.433
- Are you okay?
- Pika.

194
00:10:57.166 --> 00:10:59.933
Perfect. This is what I've been searching for.

195
00:11:00.066 --> 00:11:04.433
Just wait. When it comes to what I can do, you haven't seen anything.

196
00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.000
Oh, my gosh. I can't believe it worked.

197
00:11:07.933 --> 00:11:09.600
Say, good match.

198
00:11:10.033 --> 00:11:11.433
- I have a thought.
- Huh?

199
00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:15.233
Since the loudmouth's Pikachu seems as strong as the twerp's Pikachu,

200
00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:17.766
why don't we grab them both for a double play?

201
00:11:17.833 --> 00:11:18.766
- Oh?
- Whoa!

202
00:11:18.833 --> 00:11:20.600
You're a genius, genius.

203
00:11:20.666 --> 00:11:24.233
Of course. Feel free to recognize that all you want.

204
00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:25.433
Yeah.

205
00:11:28.633 --> 00:11:29.966
Let me reward you.

206
00:11:30.033 --> 00:11:32.100
That means the boss will reward me.

207
00:11:33.433 --> 00:11:35.466
And I'll be wide awake.

208
00:11:36.433 --> 00:11:39.466
- Uh, Jessie to Meowth.
- Huh?

209
00:11:40.866 --> 00:11:42.533
Let's roll this rock.

210
00:11:43.633 --> 00:11:44.500
Thank you.

211
00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:51.033
We got it. Does that mean Ash will be all better soon?

212
00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.833
Right. Let's hurry back.

213
00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:53.866
Yeah!

214
00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:57.666
- Hurry, Clemont!
- Wait for me, Bonnie!

215
00:12:00.833 --> 00:12:02.833
- Look at that.
- Is that Ash?

216
00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:05.366
- How can he be battling?
- Denne?

217
00:12:05.433 --> 00:12:07.333
Hmm. Hold on.

218
00:12:09.166 --> 00:12:10.433
- Is that...?
- Huh?

219
00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:11.433
Bring it on!

220
00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.000
- Serena!
- Huh?

221
00:12:13.066 --> 00:12:14.966
- Why are you dressed up like--?
- Uh...

222
00:12:19.366 --> 00:12:20.466
Why are you?

223
00:12:23.533 --> 00:12:27.133
- Huh? They your friends?
- Friends? My friends?

224
00:12:29.033 --> 00:12:30.900
- Yeah, you bet.
- Pika, Pika.

225
00:12:30.966 --> 00:12:32.666
Did you get the medicine?

226
00:12:33.266 --> 00:12:36.133
Uh-huh. Ash will feel much better in no time.

227
00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:38.200
What about you?

228
00:12:38.633 --> 00:12:41.266
He challenged Ash and Pikachu to a battle.

229
00:12:41.966 --> 00:12:43.533
Sure. I get it.

230
00:12:43.933 --> 00:12:48.133
Or at least, I think I get it. You just leave the rest to me.

231
00:12:48.566 --> 00:12:50.133
Right. I'm counting on you.

232
00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.466
- Mm-hm.
- Okay, let's go.

233
00:12:53.033 --> 00:12:54.066
Mm.

234
00:12:55.533 --> 00:12:58.100
- Hmm.
- Oh, yeah. Good luck, Ash.

235
00:12:58.166 --> 00:12:59.633
- Huh?
- Pika!

236
00:13:01.633 --> 00:13:04.033
Sorry about that. I didn't mean to make you wait.

237
00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.533
- Huh?
- Pika? Pika.

238
00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.533
All right. Back to the battle.

239
00:13:08.433 --> 00:13:10.266
Here, take this.

240
00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.500
Please, Ash. You've gotta get well quick.

241
00:13:19.566 --> 00:13:21.533
Let's let the medicine work.

242
00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:24.633
Now, Pikachu. Thunderbolt, let's go.

243
00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:28.033
It's party time. Let's show them how to rock out.

244
00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:29.266
Thunderbolt!

245
00:13:35.333 --> 00:13:36.433
Good stuff.

246
00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.933
Check this out. Use quick attack.

247
00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.000
You use quick attack, as well.

248
00:13:47.466 --> 00:13:48.566
- What's that?!
- Huh?

249
00:13:55.566 --> 00:13:56.400
Huh?

250
00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:12.000
♪ Prepare for trouble You don't have a clue, oh, yeah ♪

251
00:14:12.433 --> 00:14:14.466
♪ And make it double ♪

252
00:14:14.533 --> 00:14:18.933
♪ The anguish of not knowing What else to do ♪

253
00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:23.533
♪ To protect the world from devastation ♪

254
00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:25.566
♪ Oh, yeah ♪

255
00:14:25.633 --> 00:14:26.733
♪Testify ♪

256
00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:29.800
♪ Uniting all people within our nation ♪

257
00:14:29.866 --> 00:14:33.666
♪ Oh, yeah ♪

258
00:14:33.733 --> 00:14:34.833
♪ Right on ♪

259
00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.666
♪ Dudes, oh, yeah ♪

260
00:14:37.733 --> 00:14:39.433
♪ Wobba ♪

261
00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.600
♪ To denounce the evils Of truth and love ♪

262
00:14:43.666 --> 00:14:46.033
♪ To extend our reach to the stars above ♪

263
00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:48.800
♪ See what the new kid On the block's made of ♪

264
00:14:48.866 --> 00:14:54.666
♪ Love's evil and so are you And that still holds true ♪

265
00:14:54.733 --> 00:14:57.233
♪ But wait, there's so much more ♪

266
00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.900
♪ Hold on to your seats ♪

267
00:14:58.966 --> 00:15:00.866
♪ Get ready ♪

268
00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:03.466
Would you like to know who we are?

269
00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.200
We traveled here from a rising star.

270
00:15:06.266 --> 00:15:08.066
To mess with you dumb twerps.

271
00:15:08.133 --> 00:15:10.633
Hardy-har-har.

272
00:15:11.766 --> 00:15:14.533
Your gullible nature knows no bounds.

273
00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:17.833
No matter the costume, we're making the rounds.

274
00:15:18.233 --> 00:15:19.966
- Jessie.
- And James.

275
00:15:20.033 --> 00:15:23.366
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of sound and light.

276
00:15:23.433 --> 00:15:26.500
Surrender now or prepare for an earsplitting fight.

277
00:15:26.566 --> 00:15:29.233
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

278
00:15:32.766 --> 00:15:34.133
Oh, we've got it.

279
00:15:34.566 --> 00:15:36.600
- You guys are back again?
- Huh?

280
00:15:36.666 --> 00:15:37.600
You know them?

281
00:15:37.666 --> 00:15:41.133
They gave me the lowdown on what's up with your Pikachu.

282
00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:42.133
They did?

283
00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.600
We were strategizing to make off with the twerp's Pikachu

284
00:15:45.666 --> 00:15:47.700
once it was in a weakened battling state.

285
00:15:47.766 --> 00:15:50.400
But when we realized there were two strong Pikachu...

286
00:15:50.466 --> 00:15:54.133
We figured out the best thing we could do was wait. Huh?

287
00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:57.133
Is that the twerpette dressed up as the twerp?

288
00:15:57.566 --> 00:15:58.400
Busted!

289
00:15:58.466 --> 00:16:01.300
Say, you're right. What's with the getup?

290
00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:04.433
Are those chumps into cosplaying?

291
00:16:04.866 --> 00:16:07.566
They said twerp. Twerpette, too.

292
00:16:07.633 --> 00:16:08.900
What's going on?

293
00:16:08.966 --> 00:16:11.100
-Pika!

294
00:16:11.166 --> 00:16:14.633
Pikachu!

295
00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.500
Save your strength, Pikachu.

296
00:16:16.566 --> 00:16:21.300
Your zaps are worth zip-zero-nada when you fling them against our zappy traps.

297
00:16:21.366 --> 00:16:24.166
All right. We've won, you know, so, let's go.

298
00:16:24.733 --> 00:16:26.700
That's all for the show.

299
00:16:26.766 --> 00:16:28.200
Wobbuffet!

300
00:16:29.266 --> 00:16:32.333
Huh? Hey, come back here!

301
00:16:34.866 --> 00:16:36.166
Huh?

302
00:16:37.466 --> 00:16:40.233
Who had the nerve to stop our progress?

303
00:16:40.866 --> 00:16:43.300
That was me. Tough, Team Rocket.

304
00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:44.466
You're all right?

305
00:16:45.533 --> 00:16:47.133
Look, it's the twerp!

306
00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:49.433
But you were so sick before.

307
00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:52.133
Not now. Thanks to Clemont and Bonnie.

308
00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.500
I guess I shouldn't be surprised.

309
00:16:54.566 --> 00:16:57.666
A normal person would've taken a day or more to get well.

310
00:16:58.433 --> 00:17:02.233
So, Serena, you battled in my place, right?

311
00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:04.466
- Huh?
- Uh... what's going on?

312
00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:10.066
We can talk about that later. Right now, getting Pikachu back is all that counts.

313
00:17:10.133 --> 00:17:12.099
I really hope you'll forgive me.

314
00:17:12.466 --> 00:17:13.800
I meant no harm.

315
00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:17.333
You!

316
00:17:18.266 --> 00:17:19.166
Ash!

317
00:17:23.533 --> 00:17:24.433
Ah.

318
00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:28.366
- Okay. Let's do it, Greninja.
- Ja.

319
00:17:28.433 --> 00:17:32.466
Oh, if we had only gotten away while the getting was good, we'd be gone.

320
00:17:33.433 --> 00:17:35.533
Inkay, psybeam!

321
00:17:35.966 --> 00:17:39.533
- You're up, Gourgeist. Use shadow ball.
- Inkay.

322
00:17:40.333 --> 00:17:41.900
Inkay!

323
00:17:41.966 --> 00:17:44.000
Gourgeist!

324
00:17:44.066 --> 00:17:46.166
Greninja, water shuriken.

325
00:17:47.466 --> 00:17:49.166
Greninja!

326
00:17:49.233 --> 00:17:52.200
Let's help them out. Braixen, use flamethrower.

327
00:17:52.266 --> 00:17:55.133
Pancham, use dark pulse, and, Sylveon, use swift.

328
00:17:56.333 --> 00:17:58.333
Braixen!

329
00:17:58.400 --> 00:17:59.566
Pancham!

330
00:17:59.633 --> 00:18:00.900
Sylveon!

331
00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:06.666
Wow, she rocks.

332
00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.800
Now, Greninja, use cut.

333
00:18:09.833 --> 00:18:12.466
Greninja!

334
00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.166
- Unfair.
- I'm calling foul.

335
00:18:16.233 --> 00:18:17.166
Dumb call.

336
00:18:18.266 --> 00:18:19.500
- Pikachu.
- Pika.

337
00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:22.733
Thank goodness you're okay.

338
00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:25.300
- Yeah, rock 'n' roll!
- Pika!

339
00:18:25.366 --> 00:18:27.600
- You okay, buddy?
- Pika, Pi.

340
00:18:29.133 --> 00:18:30.566
Now what do we do?

341
00:18:30.633 --> 00:18:32.533
Act like we lost.

342
00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:34.333
- Don't look now.
- Huh?

343
00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:38.233
Now, Pikachu, use thunderbolt.

344
00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.066
Spike, thunderbolt, too.

345
00:18:40.133 --> 00:18:41.166
- Pika!
- Pika!

346
00:18:41.233 --> 00:18:46.800
Pikachu!

347
00:18:49.933 --> 00:18:53.933
Guess my reward from the boss is gonna have to wait a bit longer.

348
00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.200
Hey, what reward?

349
00:18:55.266 --> 00:18:57.366
If anyone gets a reward, it's me.

350
00:18:57.433 --> 00:18:59.866
It's my dream, not yours!

351
00:18:59.933 --> 00:19:01.800
We're blasting off again!

352
00:19:01.866 --> 00:19:04.333
- Wobbuffet!
- Gourgeist!

353
00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.433
- We did it, Pikachu.
- Pikachu.

354
00:19:08.866 --> 00:19:10.100
Thanks for all your help.

355
00:19:11.833 --> 00:19:14.366
- By the way...
- Huh?

356
00:19:15.233 --> 00:19:18.400
I really don't like the way you were pulling my leg.

357
00:19:18.966 --> 00:19:22.766
But I gotta admit, the way you worked with your Pokémon...

358
00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.900
you majorly rocked the house! Yeah!

359
00:19:27.766 --> 00:19:28.900
Uh...

360
00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.900
Thanks, Jimmy.

361
00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.966
All right. I think it's time for a jam.

362
00:19:34.033 --> 00:19:34.866
Yeah!

363
00:19:37.266 --> 00:19:39.133
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

364
00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:41.433
Yes!

365
00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:46.800
Pika!

366
00:19:47.233 --> 00:19:50.233
Oh, yeah. You came to battle with me, didn't you?

367
00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:51.933
All right, what do you say?

368
00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:53.866
Bring it on, my brother.

369
00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:55.600
Hmm.

370
00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:01.433
Sorry about that. You don't mind if I have something to eat first?

371
00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.433
Food? Now?

372
00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:05.433
I haven't eaten anything all day, and I'm starving.

373
00:20:06.766 --> 00:20:10.900
- I'll whip something up quick.
- Wait a sec. I wanna help, too.

374
00:20:10.966 --> 00:20:12.033
Dedenne.

375
00:20:13.366 --> 00:20:18.566
Wanna join us, Jimmy? We've got plenty. Everything Clemont makes is so good.

376
00:20:21.166 --> 00:20:23.133
That sounds really nice, Serena.

377
00:20:26.666 --> 00:20:29.800
It's amazing how a Pokémon battle can be a catalyst

378
00:20:29.866 --> 00:20:32.500
for so many friendships and encounters.

379
00:20:32.566 --> 00:20:36.266
And that must be what's crossing Serena's mind as she watches

380
00:20:36.333 --> 00:20:39.633
Ash, Jimmy and their Pikachu sitting there together...

381
00:20:44.466 --> 00:20:46.300
..as the journey continues.
